WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.275
Section 7: Legal resources for citizens pursuing accountability.

00:00:05.225 --> 00:00:10.537
The Canadian Civil Liberties Association defends against government overreach.

00:00:10.537 --> 00:00:14.250
Democracy Watch advocates for democratic reform.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:18.450
Pro Bono Ontario offers free legal representation.

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:28.775
The Canadian Bar Association directory helps you find lawyers specializing in criminal law, public interest litigation, or constitutional law in your province.
